<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15050" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēbrĭōsus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		ebrius, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>given to drinking</i>, <i>addicted to
				drunkenness.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hunc scribunt ebriosum esse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fat. 5, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plurimum interesse inter ebrium et ebriosum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 83, 11</span></i>
			.—As <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēbrĭōsus</span></b> , i,
				m., <i>a drunkard</i>, <i>sot</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exempla ebriosorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 2, 17, 53</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 30, 15, 51, § 145
				al.</span></i>—<i>Comp.</i>, <i><span class="en">Cat. 27,
			4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acina,</span>”
				i. e. <i>full of juice</i>, <i>juicy</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					27, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
